AND THE ONLY WITNESS.

00:00:16.983 --> 00:00:20.453 line:0%
HIS WIDOW, THE FIRST LADY.

00:00:19.185 --> 00:00:22.355 line:0%
IN HER FIRST ON CAMERA

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:24.424 line:0%
INTERVIEW SINCE THE ATTACK, SHE

00:00:22.522 --> 00:00:25.625 line:0%
SPOKE, EXCLUSIVELY, WITH CNN'S

00:00:24.591 --> 00:00:27.560 line:0%
MATT RIVERS ABOUT WHAT HAPPENED

00:00:25.792 --> 00:00:29.629 line:0%
THAT NIGHT, AND THE QUESTIONS

00:00:27.727 --> 00:00:34.334 line:0%
THAT ARE STILL UNANSWERED.

00:00:31.164 --> 00:00:35.068 line:0%
&gt;&gt; WHEN GUNMEN STORMED HAITI'S

00:00:34.501 --> 00:00:36.236 line:0%
PRESIDENTIAL RESIDENCE, AND

00:00:35.235 --> 00:00:37.570 line:0%
ASSASSINATED THE PRESIDENT OF

00:00:36.403 --> 00:00:38.171 line:0%
HAITI, JUST ONE WITNESS WAS

00:00:37.737 --> 00:00:39.672 line:0%
THERE WHEN HE DIED.

00:00:39.105 --> 00:00:40.006 line:0%
&gt;&gt; MADAM FIRST LADY, HOW ARE

00:00:39.839 --> 00:00:43.043 line:0%
YOU?

00:00:40.173 --> 00:00:44.377 line:0%
&gt;&gt; HIS WIFE, HAITI'S FIRST LADY,

00:00:43.209 --> 00:00:48.148 line:0%
FLANKED BY PRIVATE SECURITY,

00:00:44.544 --> 00:00:49.416 line:0%
SHE AGREED TO GO ON CAMERA FOR

00:00:48.314 --> 00:00:51.117 line:0%
THE FIRST TIME, WITH HER SIDE

00:00:49.582 --> 00:00:51.518 line:0%
OF A STORY THAT IS LEFT HER

00:00:51.284 --> 00:00:56.256 line:0%
SHAKEN.

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:56.923 line:0%
&gt;&gt; YOU HAVE ARMED SECURITY,

00:00:56.423 --> 00:01:00.693 line:0%
HERE, AT THIS INTERVIEW.

00:00:57.891 --> 00:01:03.263 line:0%
WE HAVE BEEN ASKED, AND AGREED,

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:05.098 line:0%
NOT TO DISCLOSE THE LOCATION OF

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:11.037 line:0%
WHERE WE ARE TALKING RIGHT NOW.

00:01:07.033 --> 00:01:12.439 line:0%
YOU ARE, OBVIOUSLY, AT LEAST,

00:01:11.204 --> 00:01:12.806 line:0%
THINKING ABOUT THREATS TO YOUR

00:01:12.605 --> 00:01:16.042 line:0%
LIFE.

00:01:14.107 --> 00:01:16.676 line:0%
DO YOU FEEL LIKE YOUR, LIFE

00:01:16.209 --> 00:01:18.511 line:0%
RIGHT, NOW IS AT RISK?

00:01:18.244 --> 00:01:20.947 line:0%
&gt;&gt; IT IS.

00:01:20.346 --> 00:01:24.317 line:0%
I WASN'T SUPPOSED TO BE ALIVE.

00:01:22.615 --> 00:01:26.886 line:0%
&gt;&gt; IN A LONG CONVERSATION,

00:01:24.484 --> 00:01:28.855 line:0%
SWITCHING BETWEEN HAITIAN

00:01:27.053 --> 00:01:31.024 line:0%
CREOLE, AND ENGLISH, SHE

00:01:29.022 --> 00:01:33.960 line:0%
DESCRIBED, AND VIVID DETAIL,

00:01:31.191 --> 00:01:34.561 line:0%
WHAT'S HAPPENED, THE NIGHT HER

00:01:34.127 --> 00:01:37.764 line:0%
HUSBAND WAS KILLED.

00:01:35.962 --> 00:01:39.899 line:0%
IT WAS AROUND ONE AM, SHE SAYS,

00:01:37.931 --> 00:01:42.669 line:0%
WHEN THE SHOOTING STARTED.

00:01:41.034 --> 00:01:45.038 line:0%
IT WASN'T SOMETHING SMALL, IT

00:01:42.836 --> 00:01:45.438 line:0%
WAS THE SOUNDS OF AUTOMATIC

00:01:45.205 --> 00:01:49.242 line:0%
WEAPONS.

00:01:47.006 --> 00:01:50.343 line:0%
BULLET HOLE, STILL POCKMARK

00:01:49.409 --> 00:01:51.144 line:0%
INGA COMPOUND, AT THE TIME THAT

00:01:50.510 --> 00:01:51.611 line:0%
SHE, AND HER HUSBAND, HIDDEN IN

00:01:51.311 --> 00:01:52.345 line:0%
THE BEDROOM.

00:01:51.778 --> 00:01:53.046 line:0%
MINUTES LATER, SHE SAID THE

00:01:52.512 --> 00:01:53.847 line:0%
DOOR BURST OPEN, GUNFIRE,

00:01:53.213 --> 00:01:54.514 line:0%
RIPPING THROUGH THE AIR, AND AT

00:01:54.013 --> 00:01:55.248 line:0%
FIRST, ONLY SHE WAS HIT.

00:01:54.681 --> 00:01:55.915 line:0%
FACE DOWN, AND BLEEDING, SHE

00:01:55.415 --> 00:01:56.716 line:0%
THINKS ABOUT A DOZEN MEN

00:01:56.082 --> 00:01:57.317 line:0%
RANSACKED THE ROOM, LOOKING FOR

00:01:56.883 --> 00:01:58.051 line:0%
SOMETHING SPECIFIC.

00:01:57.484 --> 00:01:58.785 line:0%
THEY CAME TO FIND SOMETHING,

00:01:58.218 --> 00:01:59.552 line:0%
BECAUSE I HEARD THEM SAYING,

00:01:58.952 --> 00:02:00.320 line:0%
THAT ISN'T IT, THAT ISN'T, IT

00:01:59.719 --> 00:02:01.020 line:0%
THERE IT IS, WHICH MEANS THEY

00:02:00.487 --> 00:02:01.488 line:0%
FOUND THEY WERE THEY WERE

00:02:01.187 --> 00:02:02.188 line:0%
LOOKING FOR.

00:02:01.654 --> 00:02:02.956 line:0%
SHE DOESN'T KNOW WHAT THEY

00:02:02.355 --> 00:02:03.756 line:0%
FOUND, BUT AFTER THEY DID, IN

00:02:03.123 --> 00:02:04.557 line:0%
ATTACKER APPROACHED HER HUSBAND,

00:02:03.923 --> 00:02:05.358 line:0%
AT THIS POINT, STILL ALIVE, AND

00:02:04.724 --> 00:02:06.126 line:0%
UNHARMED, AND GOT ON THE PHONE.

00:02:05.525 --> 00:02:07.460 line:0%
SHE SAYS, THAT PERSON CALLED

00:02:06.292 --> 00:02:08.061 line:0%
SOMEONE, AND DESCRIBED WHAT MY

00:02:07.627 --> 00:02:10.897 line:0%
HUSBAND LOOKED LIKE.

00:02:08.995 --> 00:02:11.264 line:0%
SAYING HE WAS TALL, SKINNY, AND

00:02:11.064 --> 00:02:14.634 line:0%
BLACK.

00:02:12.432 --> 00:02:15.969 line:0%
THEN THE PERSON ON THE PHONE

00:02:14.801 --> 00:02:17.170 line:0%
MUST OF CONFIRMED TO THE

00:02:16.136 --> 00:02:17.737 line:0%
SHOOTER THAT WAS HIM, AND SHOT

00:02:17.337 --> 00:02:20.073 line:0%
HIM ON THE FLOOR.

00:02:18.404 --> 00:02:21.641 line:0%
THE PRESIDENT WAS DEAD, AND THE

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:27.046 line:0%
ATTACKERS, LEAVING SOON AFTER.

00:02:22.742 --> 00:02:29.816 line:0%
HE BELIEVES THE SHE WAS DEAD TO,

00:02:27.213 --> 00:02:30.283 line:0%
CRITICALLY WOUNDED, SHE LIFTED

00:02:29.983 --> 00:02:33.052 line:0%
HERSELF UP.

00:02:31.751 --> 00:02:33.786 line:0%
&gt;&gt; WHEN YOU STOOD UP, AND YOU

00:02:33.219 --> 00:02:34.320 line:0%
SAW HE WAS DEAD, DID YOU SAY

00:02:33.953 --> 00:02:37.557 line:0%
ANYTHING TO HIM?

00:02:35.455 --> 00:02:38.925 line:0%
&gt;&gt; IN MY HEART, I SAID

00:02:37.724 --> 00:02:39.492 line:0%
SOMETHING I USED TO TELL HIM

00:02:39.092 --> 00:02:42.495 line:0%
WHEN HE WAS ALIVE.

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:44.330 line:0%
WE ARE MARRIED, FOR BETTER OR

00:02:42.662 --> 00:02:44.697 line:0%
WORSE, AND EVEN BEYOND THE

00:02:44.497 --> 00:02:47.467 line:0%
GRAVE.

00:02:45.999 --> 00:02:51.804 line:0%
HER LEFT SIDE, BLEEDING, AND

00:02:47.634 --> 00:02:52.572 line:0%
HER RIGHT ARM, SHREDDED BY

00:02:51.971 --> 00:02:53.373 line:0%
GUNFIRE, SHE IS LET OUT OF THE

00:02:52.739 --> 00:02:53.940 line:0%
HOUSE BY POLICE, AND COMES TO A

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:55.141 line:0%
QUICK CONCLUSION.

00:02:54.107 --> 00:02:56.576 line:0%
THE DOZENS OF SECURITY GUARDS,

00:02:55.308 --> 00:02:57.744 line:0%
NORMALLY ON HAND TO PROTECT THE

00:02:56.743 --> 00:03:00.680 line:0%
PRESIDENT, EITHER LET THE

00:02:57.911 --> 00:03:01.147 line:0%
ATTACKERS, IN OR ABANDONED

00:03:00.847 --> 00:03:04.184 line:0%
THEIR POSTS.

00:03:02.182 --> 00:03:04.651 line:0%
&gt;&gt; THERE IS NO OTHER

00:03:04.350 --> 00:03:08.388 line:0%
EXPLANATION.

00:03:06.619 --> 00:03:09.589 line:0%
YOU ARE THERE TO PROTECT THE

00:03:08.555 --> 00:03:11.057 line:0%
PRESIDENT, AND THE PRESIDENT IS

00:03:09.756 --> 00:03:11.524 line:0%
DEAD, BECAUSE YOU ARE NOWHERE

00:03:11.224 --> 00:03:15.161 line:0%
TO BE FOUND.

00:03:12.058 --> 00:03:16.062 line:0%
ADDING, SHE WAS AMAZED,

00:03:15.328 --> 00:03:16.529 line:0%
APPARENTLY NOT A SINGLE GUARD

00:03:16.229 --> 00:03:19.299 line:0%
WAS INJURED.

00:03:17.197 --> 00:03:19.966 line:0%
SHE BELIEVES IT IS PART OF A

00:03:19.465 --> 00:03:21.634 line:0%
MUCH LARGER CONSPIRACY.

00:03:20.633 --> 00:03:22.702 line:0%
&gt;&gt; YOUR HUSBAND'S FUNERAL YOU

00:03:21.801 --> 00:03:24.637 line:0%
SAID, QUOTE, THE RAPTORS ARE

00:03:22.869 --> 00:03:25.171 line:0%
STILL OUT THERE, WATCHING, AND

00:03:24.804 --> 00:03:26.773 line:0%
LAUGHING AT US.

00:03:26.105 --> 00:03:28.508 line:0%
WHAT DID YOU MEAN BY THAT?

00:03:28.208 --> 00:03:31.444 line:0%
&gt;&gt; THEY ARE.

00:03:30.843 --> 00:03:32.545 line:0%
NO ONE IS BEING ARRESTED YET.

00:03:31.844 --> 00:03:35.081 line:0%
THE PEOPLE THAT THEY ARREST,

00:03:32.712 --> 00:03:35.682 line:0%
THESE ARE THE PEOPLE THAT

00:03:35.248 --> 00:03:38.284 line:0%
PULLED THE TRIGGER.

00:03:36.683 --> 00:03:38.818 line:0%
THEY WON'T PULL THE TRIGGER

00:03:38.451 --> 00:03:42.255 line:0%
WITH NO OTHERS.

00:03:39.719 --> 00:03:43.990 line:0%
SO WHAT WE DO NEED IS THE

00:03:42.422 --> 00:03:44.757 line:0%
PEOPLE WHO PAID FOR THAT, AND

00:03:44.157 --> 00:03:49.329 line:0%
THE PEOPLE WHO GAVE THE ORDER.

00:03:46.759 --> 00:03:51.197 line:0%
&gt;&gt; SO, YOU THINK THAT PERSON,

00:03:49.495 --> 00:03:51.698 line:0%
AND THAT PERSON, COULD NOT HAVE

00:03:51.364 --> 00:03:55.301 line:0%
BEEN ARRESTED?

00:03:55.101 --> 00:03:59.906 line:0%
&gt;&gt; NO.

00:03:56.636 --> 00:04:01.407 line:0%
&gt;&gt; THIS WAS LED TO THE ARREST

00:04:00.073 --> 00:04:03.142 line:0%
OF MORE THAN 40 SUSPECTS, BUT,

00:04:01.574 --> 00:04:04.377 line:0%
STILL HAS NOT PROVIDED A MOTIVE

00:04:03.309 --> 00:04:06.012 line:0%
FOR THE PRESIDENT'S KILLING, OR

00:04:04.544 --> 00:04:06.412 line:0%
IDENTIFIED A MASTERMIND BEHIND

00:04:06.179 --> 00:04:08.548 line:0%
IT ALL.

00:04:06.879 --> 00:04:10.250 line:0%
THAT, LEAVING A VACUUM, THAT

00:04:08.715 --> 00:04:11.918 line:0%
HAITI FLOODED WITH THEORIES

00:04:10.416 --> 00:04:13.553 line:0%
ABOUT WHO KILLED A PRESIDENT

00:04:12.085 --> 00:04:15.555 line:0%
WHO, AT THE TIME OF HIS DEATH,

00:04:13.720 --> 00:04:16.122 line:0%
WAS IN BATTLE, LARGELY

00:04:15.722 --> 00:04:19.158 line:0%
UNPOPULAR LEADER.

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:20.793 line:0%
EVEN STILL, FOR HIS WIDOW, THIS

00:04:19.325 --> 00:04:24.497 line:0%
WAS AN UNIMAGINABLE ENDING.

00:04:22.061 --> 00:04:26.499 line:0%
&gt;&gt; I NEVER THOUGHT THAT THE

00:04:24.664 --> 00:04:27.033 line:0%
LEVEL OF HATE THE EVER EXISTED

00:04:26.666 --> 00:04:30.169 line:0%
IN THE COUNTRY.

00:04:28.234 --> 00:04:30.570 line:0%
&gt;&gt; YOU NEVER THOUGHT THIS COULD

00:04:30.336 --> 00:04:32.572 line:0%
HAPPEN?

00:04:32.372 --> 00:04:33.473 line:0%
&gt;&gt; NO.

00:04:32.905 --> 00:04:34.107 line:0%
&gt;&gt; BECAUSE YOUR HUSBAND DID

00:04:33.640 --> 00:04:34.540 line:0%
HAVE A LOT OF ENEMIES.

00:04:34.274 --> 00:04:35.275 line:0%
&gt;&gt; HE DID.

00:04:34.707 --> 00:04:36.042 line:0%
BUT, I DIDN'T KNOW THAT THEY

00:04:35.441 --> 00:04:37.910 line:0%
HATED THAT MUCH, TO KILL HIM.

00:04:36.209 --> 00:04:39.646 line:0%
&gt;&gt; WE ASKED HER, ARE YOU

00:04:38.077 --> 00:04:41.814 line:0%
CONFIDENT IN THE INVESTIGATION

00:04:39.812 --> 00:04:42.248 line:0%
THAT IS ONGOING ON THE ISLAND

00:04:41.981 --> 00:04:43.783 line:0%
RIGHT NOW?

00:04:43.216 --> 00:04:46.386 line:0%
AND SHE BASICALLY SAID, NO.

00:04:44.584 --> 00:04:47.320 line:0%
SHE SPECIFICALLY SAID, SHE

00:04:46.552 --> 00:04:48.588 line:0%
WANTS U.S. INVESTIGATORS,

00:04:47.487 --> 00:04:51.090 line:0%
ALREADY INVOLVED IN THIS

00:04:48.755 --> 00:04:54.260 line:0%
INVESTIGATION, TO CONTINUE, AND

00:04:51.257 --> 00:04:57.297 line:0%
RAMP UP THEIR PARTICIPATION.

00:04:55.728 --> 00:04:59.165 line:0%
SHE ALSO, SPECIFICALLY, IS

00:04:57.463 --> 00:05:01.534 line:0%
CALLING FOR THE UN TO CREATE A

00:04:59.332 --> 00:05:03.569 line:0%
SPECIAL INVESTIGATIVE TRIBUNAL

00:05:01.701 --> 00:05:05.438 line:0%
TO INVESTIGATE THE

00:05:03.736 --> 00:05:06.973 line:0%
ASSASSINATION OF HER HUSBAND,

00:05:05.605 --> 00:05:09.309 line:0%
MUCH LIKE THEY DID IN THE MID

00:05:07.140 --> 00:05:10.043 line:0%
2000S, AFTER THE ASSASSINATION

00:05:09.475 --> 00:05:13.112 line:0%
OF LEBANON'S PRIME MINISTER.

00:05:11.044 --> 00:05:15.014 line:0%
BASICALLY, WHAT SHE IS SAYING

00:05:13.279 --> 00:05:16.282 line:0%
HERE, AND SHE IS NOT TRUSTING

00:05:15.181 --> 00:05:17.350 line:0%
THIS INVESTIGATION, UNLESS

